# Selfless Safewright: Flash and convoke ({3}{G}{G}). Bot2 casts Wrath of God on turn 2; in response Bot1 flashes in the Safewright, paying
# {G} with Mox Emerald, {1} each with Mox Ruby and Mox Pearl, and tapping the Elvish Mystic ({G}) and the Memnite ({1}) to convoke. Its trigger
# chooses Elf: the other Elf, the Mystic, is indestructible until end of turn and survives the Wrath. The Safewright itself ("other") and the
# Memnite (not an Elf) are destroyed, and so is Bot2's Llanowar Elves: only permanents you control are protected.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Elvish Mystic
Memnite
Selfless Safewright
Forest x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Llanowar Elves
Wrath of God
Plains x11

